  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">UP Police Recruitment Tentative Calendar 2025-26</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-01-05T14:20:44+05:30\">January 5, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">2:20 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.upprpb.in/#/auth/landing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Uttar Pradesh Police Recruitment and Promotion Board</a>,</strong> has released the&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"228\">recruitment calendar for 2025–26</strong>, giving candidates clarity on <strong>exam dates,</strong> <strong>notifications,</strong> and <strong>vacancies.</strong> This step ends years of uncertainty and shows the <strong>government’s focus on timely recruitment.</strong> As per <strong>CM Yogi Aditya Nath’s promise</strong>, around <strong data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"464\">30,000 new police posts</strong>&nbsp;will be created to strengthen law and order in the state.&nbsp;<strong>UPPRPB</strong> has released the notification <strong>calendar of upcoming exams</strong> which be help in <strong>year 2025.</strong> Details are mentioned <strong>below with date &amp; other details.</strong> Candidates can access the <strong>UP Police Recruitment Tentative Calendar 2025-26</strong>&nbsp;easily through the official <strong>UP Police Official website.</strong></span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">UP Police Recruitment Calendar 2025-26</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">UP Police Upcoming Recruitment Information 2025 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/up-police-recruitment-calendar-2025-26/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Calendar Released Date : <strong>18 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card Date : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Date : <strong>Will Be Updated Here Soon.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><p><strong>Not Available.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">Age Limit Details</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><p><strong>Will Be Updated Here Soon.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">30,000+ Posts</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">UP Police Upcoming Exam Information 2025 : Recruitment Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.646%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>UP Police Recruitment Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.5804%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Notification Release Date</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.6814%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.646%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Sub-Inspector (Civil Police, Platoon Commander, Armed Police, SSF)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.5804%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">12 August 2025</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.6814%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">4,543</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.646%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">ASI (Clerk, Accounts) &amp; SI (Confidential)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.5804%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">07 January 2024 / Exam Date : 02 Nov 2025</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.6814%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">921</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.646%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Computer Operator Grade-A</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.5804%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">07 January 2024 / Exam Date : 01 Nov 2025</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.6814%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1,129</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.646%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Assistant Radio Operator</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.5804%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">October – November 2025</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.6814%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">44</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.646%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Additional Computer Operator Grade-A</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.5804%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">October – November 2025</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.6814%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1,153</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.646%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Constable (Civil, PAC, SSF, Jail Warder, Mounted, Women’s PAC)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.5804%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">November 2025</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.6814%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">22,605</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 32.646%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Additional SI/ASI (Confidential &amp; others)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.5804%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">November 2025</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.6814%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">345</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #000080;\">&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download UP Police Recruitment Calendar 2025-26&nbsp;</span></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"219\">Visit the Official Website</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"319\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Go to the&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"300\">Uttar Pradesh Police Recruitment &amp; Promotion Board (UPPRPB)</strong>&nbsp;official portal.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"364\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"362\">Find the Recruitment Calendar Link</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"500\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, look for the notification&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"457\">“UP Police Recruitment Calendar 2025–26”</strong>&nbsp;under the latest updates/notice section.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"532\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"530\">Open the Calendar PDF</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"680\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on the link, and the&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"593\">Recruitment Calendar PDF</strong>&nbsp;will open showing post-wise vacancy details, notification dates, and exam schedules.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"712\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"710\">Download the Calendar</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"784\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on the&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"743\">Download</strong>&nbsp;option to save the PDF on your device.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"821\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"819\">Take a Printout (Optional)</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"915\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Keep a&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"847\">hard copy</strong>&nbsp;of the calendar for quick reference during your exam preparation.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff;\"><strong>&nbsp;UP Police Upcoming Exam Information 2025 : Application Process&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"199\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"197\">Online Registration</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"245\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"215\" data-end=\"242\">UPPRPB official website</strong>.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"372\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on the link for the desired&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"315\">UP Police recruitment post</strong>&nbsp;(Constable, SI, Jail Warder, Computer Operator, etc.).</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"451\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Register with&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"409\">basic details</strong>&nbsp;like name, mobile number, and email ID.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"490\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"488\">Filling the Application Form</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"540\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Log in with your registration credentials.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"637\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Fill in personal details, educational qualifications, and category information carefully.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"706\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Select your&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"681\">exam center preference</strong>&nbsp;(if option available).</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"736\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"734\">Uploading Documents</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"873\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Upload scanned copies of your&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"800\">passport-size photograph</strong>,&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"815\">signature</strong>, and other required documents in the prescribed format.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"910\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"908\">Payment of Application Fee</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"1013\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Pay the required&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"959\">application fee online</strong>&nbsp;using Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking, or UPI.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1040\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1038\">Final Submission</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1098\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Review the form carefully before final submission.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1207\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1123\">Submit</strong>&nbsp;and take a printout of the application form and fee receipt for future reference.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff;\"><strong>&nbsp;UP Police Upcoming Exam Information 2025 : Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Online / Written Examination</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Physical Measurement Test (PMT)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Physical Efficiency Test (PET)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Document Verification</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Medical Examination</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Download Exam Calendar</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/548903054_17860164231484069_5692664758693577640_n.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><b>Click Here</b></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">UP Police</span>&nbsp;Official Website</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"https://www.upprpb.in/#/auth/landing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><b>Click Here</b></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;UP Police Recruitment Calendar 2025-26 : Important Question&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Q1. When was the UP Police Recruitment Calendar 2025–26 released?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>A:</strong> The calendar has been officially released in&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"309\">2025</strong>&nbsp;by the UP Police Recruitment &amp; Promotion Board (UPPRPB).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Q2. What details are included in the recruitment calendar?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>A:</strong> It includes&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"524\">notification release dates, exam dates, number of vacancies, and posts</strong>&nbsp;to be filled.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Q3. How many vacancies are expected in UP Police recruitment 2025–26?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>A:</strong> Around&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"648\">30,000 new posts</strong>&nbsp;are planned across different categories like&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"760\">Constable, SI, Jail Warder, Computer Operator, and other posts</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Q4. Why is the recruitment calendar important for candidates?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>A:</strong> &nbsp;It provides&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1034\">clarity about exam schedules</strong>, helps in&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1069\">planning preparation</strong>, and removes confusion caused by delays.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\